\toprule
Metric & Value \\
\midrule
4-class accuracy (\%) & 69.52 $[68.9, 70.2]$ \\
BOS-seeded baseline (\%) & 83.3 \\
$\Delta$ (prompted $-$ BOS) & $-$13.78\,pp \\
\midrule
